&lt;li&gt;Work cross-functionally with legal, product management, hardware, and executive stakeholders to align on required device security compliance frameworks &amp;amp; timelines, such as EU RED 3.3 (d)(e)(f) and the EU Cyber Resilience Act.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the device security compliance tracker across product lines, geographies, customer segments, and timelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bootstrap Verkada’s internal product security compliance team, taking an automation-first approach to validating product compliance with cybersecurity regulations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and engage with 3rd party testing labs to validate compliance when required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare and file required technical documentation to prove compliance with cybersecurity regulations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate with security engineers to direct internal product teams for remediation of compliance gaps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
