&lt;li&gt;Ability to effectively and autonomously accomplish outcomes despite ambiguous situations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least 5 years of experience working on regulatory compliance for IoT, OT, ICS, or similar domains.&amp;nbsp; Prior experience managing other compliance schemes such as FCC or UL a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have worked in an agile team environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;(Bonus) Knowledge of product cybersecurity certifications for IoT/OT domains, such as ETSI EN 303 645 or ISO/IEC 62443.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;(Bonus) Experience with scripting languages such as Python.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
