&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About MISUMI Americas&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;MISUMI Americas, a division of MISUMI Group, is a leading provider of standard, configurable, and custom manufacturing solutions. By integrating a vast catalog of components with a world-class digital manufacturing platform, MISUMI Americas empowers engineers and procurement teams to accelerate innovation across the entire product lifecycle. With operations in the San Francisco Bay Area and Chicago, the company serves as a vital partner for the most innovative companies in the Americas.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Impact In This Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;As the Director of Product Management, you will own the product strategy and integrated roadmap across multiple product domains at MISUMI Americas, including catalog platform and search, e-commerce platform experience, supply chain, customer experience, and business systems. You will champion a significant product organization, directing both senior individual contributors and people managers to translate high-level company strategy into actionable, impact-driven roadmaps that deliver measurable results.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Serving as the vital link between executive leadership, Engineering, Design, Operations, and Go-To-Market teams, you ensure we are solving the most critical problems with increasing speed and precision. You will operate as both a visionary leader and a hands-on navigator, establishing clear direction while actively resolving trade-offs and elevating the standard of excellence across our expanding product management organization.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;You will report to the VP, Product Management.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Be Doing:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Domain strategy and portfolio leadership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Own the product strategy and integrated roadmap across multiple domain areas, ensuring investments are focused on the highest-value opportunities for customers and the business&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Translate company strategy and commercial priorities into a coherent, well-sequenced domain roadmap with clear goals, milestones, and business rationale&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Build and maintain a strong domain-level perspective on the competitive landscape, customer needs, operational constraints, and technology capabilities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Identify and resolve cross-domain dependencies and tradeoffs, driving alignment across product areas so that team roadmaps are mutually reinforcing rather than at odds&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Develop business cases for significant investments and secure alignment across the management team and senior stakeholders&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team leadership and PM development&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Lead, develop, and manage a substantial product management organization that includes both individual contributor PMs and PM managers — building a high-performing team with strong product judgment, communication discipline, and execution rigor&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Coach PMs on discovery, prioritization, scoping, stakeholder alignment, launch readiness, and outcome measurement — raising the quality bar across all dimensions of the craft&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Create a collaborative, accountable team culture where PMs are growing in independence, taking ownership, and delivering results with minimal escalation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Drive consistent standards for roadmap development, requirements definition, goal-setting, and retrospective learning across the team&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Contribute to talent strategy, including hiring, onboarding, and long-term development planning for the PM organization&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-functional alignment and stakeholder partnership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Build and sustain strong working relationships with Engineering, Design, Operations, Sales, Marketing, and Finance leadership to ensure product direction is well understood and collaboratively shaped&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Serve as the primary escalation point for cross-functional issues within the domain, driving resolution through clear communication, good judgment, and constructive tradeoff decisions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Represent the product domain in senior leadership and executive forums, communicating strategy, roadmap status, tradeoffs, and results with clarity and confidence&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Foster a cross-functional environment where information flows freely, decisions are made at the right level, and teams trust each other to deliver&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Roadmap execution and operational discipline&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Ensure PMs maintain the rigor and discipline needed to deliver against priorities: clear requirements, well-managed scope, proactive risk identification, and tight coordination with Engineering and Design&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Establish and track meaningful input and output metrics across the domain, using quantitative and qualitative data to evaluate impact, inform prioritization, and drive continuous improvement&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Drive successful product launches by ensuring all functions — Engineering, Operations, Sales, Marketing, and Support — are prepared and aligned&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Maintain visibility into team-level execution, surfacing progress and risks to leadership with candor and regularity&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Apply Agile methodologies thoughtfully, helping teams structure their work for sustainable velocity and predictable delivery&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Travel approximately 15% annually for team collaboration, customer research, partner visits, and industry engagement&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;10+ years of product management experience, with at least 4 years leading and managing a multi-layered PM organization that includes both individual contributors and people managers&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Demonstrated success leading product strategy and execution for a large-catalog B2B or B2C e-commerce platform — experience with catalog scale (hundreds of thousands to millions of SKUs), search and navigation, pricing display and transactional workflows is required&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Track record of building and maintaining integrated roadmaps across multiple teams or product areas, including managing cross-domain dependencies and stakeholder alignment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Proven ability to develop PM talent — hiring, coaching, and growing product managers into more senior and independent contributors&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Experience building and gaining senior leadership alignment on product strategy, business cases, and investment prioritization&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Strong background in cross-functional collaboration, with demonstrated experience partnering with Engineering, Design, Operations, and commercial functions to deliver meaningful outcomes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Experience using customer insights, operational data, and business metrics to drive strategic product decisions and roadmap evolution&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Experience with Agile methodologies and the ability to apply them to drive execution discipline at the team level&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Strategic thinking: ability to synthesize business goals, customer insights, operational realities, and technology constraints into a clear, prioritized product direction&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;People leadership: proven ability to develop product managers — coaching for growth, delivering honest feedback, and building a high-performing, high-trust team&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Strong analytical skills: ability to evaluate opportunity size, build business cases, and use data to drive high-quality decisions across a complex product portfolio&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Excellent communication: able to articulate strategy and tradeoffs clearly to both executive audiences and cross-functional teams, in writing and in conversation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Influence without authority: builds trust and earns credibility across Engineering, Operations, and commercial functions through strong judgment, follow-through, and genuine partnership&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Results orientation: focused on outcomes, not just output — able to hold the team accountable to impact while navigating ambiguity and change&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Comfortable navigating systems with deep interdependencies and integrations, including large-scale catalog, transactional, and operational platforms&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Active and advancing AI practice: uses AI tools as a genuine accelerant across discovery, synthesis, prototyping, and decision-making — and is actively building toward team-level AI workflows that raise the collective capability of the PM organization, not just personal efficiency&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Working understanding of how AI is reshaping the product management role — including which PM activities are being automated, which are becoming more valuable, and what that means for how to recruit, develop, and evaluate a product team in this environment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Experience in or exposure to new hardware product development, factory automation, or mechanical/industrial engineering — understanding of the engineering workflows that drive demand for industrial components&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Background in industrial parts supply, distribution, or manufacturing supply chain, including familiarity with how procurement teams and engineers source mechanical components&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Experience managing product platforms with complex configurability requirements — such as parametric search, attribute-based filtering, or custom order logic at scale&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Familiarity with business systems and operational tooling (e.g., ERP integrations, OMS, WMS) and how they intersect with customer-facing product experiences&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Physical Demands:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;The physical demands described here are representative of those that must be met by an employee to successfully perform the essential functions of this job. Reasonable accommodations may be made to enable individuals with disabilities to perform the essential functions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;While performing the duties of this job, the employee routinely is required to sit; walk; talk and hear; use hands to keyboard, fingers, handle, and feel; stoop, kneel, crouch, twist, crawl, reach, and stretch.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Salary Range: $235,000 to $275,000 per year, depending upon experience&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Interested in learning more?&amp;nbsp; We look forward to hearing from you soon.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;We’re actively seeking teammates who:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring diverse perspectives and experience to our culture and company.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excel at being part of a strong, empathetic team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Thrive in an environment emphasizing respect, honesty, collaboration, and growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have an ‘always learning’ mindset that celebrates learning, not just wins.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help us continue to build a world-class organization that values the contributions of all of our teammates&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We encourage applications from members of underrepresented groups, including but not limited to women, members of the LGBTQ community, people of color, people with disabilities, and veterans.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

gaingels-corelight:greenhouse:7696074.descriptionHtml:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Be part of the team that defends the networks the world depends on&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Corelight defends the world’s most sensitive networks—from global commerce to national defense—quietly, relentlessly, and with resolve. As cyber threats grow faster and smarter, we serve as the trusted force behind network resilience, putting elite defense within reach.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By transforming digital footprints from physical, virtual, and cloud networks into actionable insights, we empower defenders to illuminate blind spots and stay ahead of an evolving threat landscape. Built on open-source innovations and fueled by industry leading agentic AI technology, Corelight helps teams to detect advanced threats and close cases with unprecedented clarity and precision.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We are seeking a very talented, resourceful, and collaborative person to help us grow our Professional Services team.&amp;nbsp; This person will be assisting customers to deploy and use our cybersecurity products. This is a great opportunity for someone who is passionate and committed and wants to be able to look back a year from now and say with pride, “I helped build that from the ground up.”&amp;nbsp; The role covers quite varied ground depending on the engagement.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Opportunity:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Help customers improve their cybersecurity posture, with a particular focus on process optimization&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Help investigate incidents&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Educate on Zeek Log use, including as it relates to Corelight Suricata alerts&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Design and implement technical solutions with ecosystem partners (packet brokers, asset managers, SOAR systems, etc.)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Implement queries and dashboards in SIEMs - Splunk, Elastic, Humio, etc.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Influence customers and Corelight teams and be seen as a technical expert&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Collaborate with product management on product features/integrations&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Work with back-end tools like Kafka and Logstash&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Qualifications:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;5+ years experience in a security professional services role&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Bachelor’s degree in a technical field (or equivalent experience)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Strong background in cybersecurity&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Solid verbal and written communication skills&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Enjoy designing novel solutions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Understand how to scope and describe a services engagement&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Robust problem-solving skills, the ability to learn from doing, personal accountability, and a positive and professional attitude&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Zeek log experience and log analysis skills are required&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Network administration, firewall configuration, and strong knowledge of TCP/IP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Windows/MacOS/Linux/Unix administration experience&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Scripting in (some of) Zeek, Bash, Python, Perl, Powershell, etc.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;SIEM experience (Splunk required, others a bonus)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Travel up to 50% post-COVID; some travel now, depending on customer comfort levels&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Prior startup experience preferred&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join Us?&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fueled by investments from top-tier venture capital organizations such as Crowdstrike, Accel and Insight, Corelight is one of the fastest growing network detection and response platforms in the industry.&amp;nbsp; Our passionate team thrives in a collaborative, inclusive, and geographically distributed culture. We embrace diverse perspectives, neurodiversity, curiosity and low ego results - fostering an environment where every innovator can solve the toughest challenges in cybersecurity and contribute their best work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking forward to meeting you. Check us out at&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.corelight.com&quot;&gt; www.corelight.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

gaingels-epic-games:greenhouse:600168600.descriptionHtml:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;WHAT MAKES US EPIC?&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At the core of Epic’s success are talented, passionate people. Epic prides itself on creating a collaborative, welcoming, and creative environment. Whether it’s building award-winning games or crafting engine technology that enables others to make visually stunning interactive experiences, we’re always innovating.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Being Epic means being a part of a team that continually strives to do right by our community and users. We’re constantly innovating to raise the bar of engine and game development.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;ENGINEERING - GAMES&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Unreal projects have been leading the pack of real-time entertainment with our constantly growing team of engineering experts. We’re always improving on the tools and technology that empower content developers worldwide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking an experienced Lead Gameplay Programmer to direct gameplay teams within Rocket League. You&#39;ll drive the gameplay engineering team and play a critical role in feature development for upcoming seasons.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In this role, you will&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor and coach a team of gameplay engineers, serving as the primary communication hub across disciplines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Distill high-level feature requests into actionable work items and delegate effectively&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver core gameplay features on time, flagging when the team is over- or under-scoped&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define the vision for gameplay systems and features&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Propose and review architecture and technical approaches to ensure they meet requirements and support a healthy codebase&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write code directly when needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we&#39;re looking for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional game development experience, including shipping AAA titles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading a gameplay engineering team on shipped AAA titles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong C++ skills with the ability to architect and implement gameplay mechanics and tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical and problem-solving skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working on a live service game&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Multi-platform development experience is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passion for games is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;EPIC JOB + EPIC BENEFITS = EPIC LIFE&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-userformat=&quot;{&amp;quot;2&amp;quot;:13201,&amp;quot;3&amp;quot;:{&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;:0},&amp;quot;7&amp;quot;:{&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;:[{&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;2&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;5&amp;quot;:{&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;2&amp;quot;:13421772}},{&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;2&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;3&amp;quot;:3},{&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;2&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;4&amp;quot;:1}]},&amp;quot;10&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;11&amp;quot;:4,&amp;quot;12&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;15&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Roboto&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;16&amp;quot;:10}&quot;&gt;Our intent is to cover all things that are medically necessary and improve the quality of life. We pay 100% of the premiums for both you and your dependents. Our coverage includes Medical, Dental, a Vision HRA, Long Term Disability, Life Insurance &amp;amp; a 401k with competitive match. We also offer a robust mental well-being program through Modern Health, which provides free therapy and coaching for employees &amp;amp; dependents. Throughout the year we celebrate our employees with events and company-wide paid breaks. We offer unlimited PTO and sick time and recognize individuals for 7 years of employment with a paid sabbatical.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;ABOUT US&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Epic Games​ ​is a leading interactive entertainment company. For over 30 years we&#39;ve been making award-winning games and engine technology that empowers others to make visually stunning games and 3D content that bring environments to life like never before. Epic&#39;s award-winning Unreal Engine technology not only provides game developers the ability to build high-fidelity, interactive experiences for PC, console, mobile, and VR, it is also a tool being embraced by content creators across a variety of industries such as media and entertainment, automotive, and architectural design. As we continue to build our Engine technology and develop remarkable games, we strive to build teams of world-class talent.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Like what you hear? Come be a part of something Epic!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Epic Games deeply values diverse teams and an inclusive work culture, and we are proud to be an Equal Opportunity employer. Learn more about our Equal Employment Opportunity (EEO) Policy &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.epicgames.com/site/en-US/eeo-policy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Note to Recruitment Agencies: &lt;/strong&gt;Epic does not accept any unsolicited resumes or approaches from any unauthorized third party (including recruitment or placement agencies) (i.e., a third party with whom we do not have a negotiated and validly executed agreement). We will not pay any fees to any unauthorized third party. Further details on these matters can be found &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.epicgames.com/note-to-recruitment-agencies&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

gaingels-epirus:greenhouse:5633454004.descriptionHtml:
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Epirus&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Epirus is a high-growth technology company dedicated to overcoming the asymmetric challenges inherent to the future of national security. Epirus&#39; flagship product, Leonidas, is a software-defined system built using intelligent power management techniques which allow power-hungry systems to do more with less.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Epirus, we’re always looking ahead—and that includes building relationships with forward-thinking engineers who want to shape the future of defense technology. While we may not have an immediate opening that matches your background, we invite you to express interest in future Systems Engineering opportunities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Whether your strengths lie in Data Engineering, Core Systems Engineering, or Modeling &amp;amp; Simulation, there could be a place for you on our team as we grow.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;**This posting is for resume collection in anticipation of future opportunities. A member of our Talent Acquisition team will contact you if a suitable position becomes available.**&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Learn More about our Systems Roles:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Engineering Roles&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, implement, and maintain production-quality data pipelines and transformation workflows with clear, reproducible documentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Optimize existing pipelines for performance, scalability, and reliability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage large-scale video data storage, indexing, and retrieval systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop ETL/ELT workflows using orchestration tools (e.g., Airflow).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deploy and manage containerized workloads in Docker/Kubernetes environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain data governance practices, including schema enforcement, versioning, and compliance documentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Systems Engineering Roles&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define, manage, and trace system requirements across the development lifecycle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate mission needs and operational analyses into Key Performance Parameters and system-level requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as a technical liaison to customers to ensure solutions meet mission and performance expectations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with design teams to develop and maintain Model-Based Systems Engineering (MBSE) artifacts, including structural and behavioral diagrams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with business development to propose new system architectures and applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Modeling &amp;amp; Simulation Roles&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and refine models to simulate performance at the subsystem, system, and system-of-systems level.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct engineering trade studies to inform product requirements and design decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evaluate system architectures to balance mission effectiveness, cost, and technical feasibility.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with multidisciplinary teams to validate models and drive informed decision-making.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Propose and analyze operational concepts (CONOPs) for new applications and technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Basic Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimum of &lt;strong&gt;2 years&lt;/strong&gt; of professional engineering experience in one or more of the following domains: Systems Engineering, Data Engineering, or Modeling &amp;amp; Simulation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s or Master’s degree in Electrical Engineering, Computer Science, Aerospace Engineering, or a related technical field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience contributing to the definition or management of a technical system baseline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in at least one programming language (e.g., Python, C, or C++).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced degree (MS or PhD) in a relevant discipline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with RF systems, including radar, communications, electronic warfare (EW), or phased array systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with MBSE tools and methodologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience deploying data systems in containerized environments (Docker/Kubernetes).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of DoD or defense contracting environments is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ITAR REQUIREMENTS:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To conform to U.S. Government export regulations, applicant must be a (i) U.S. citizen or national, (ii) U.S. lawful, permanent resident (aka green card holder), (iii) Refugee under 8 U.S.C. § 1157, or (iv) Asylee under 8 U.S.C. § 1158, or be eligible to obtain the required authorizations from the U.S. Department of State. &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Epirus, you’ll work with technical peers and great people—and get first crack at some of the defining technology challenges of our time. Here, “impossible” is just a challenge. We&#39;re a diverse, fast-growing team of change-makers fueling the future of energy with revolutionary solutions. &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.epirusinc.com/open-roles&quot;&gt;Join us and rewrite the rules.&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

