mbaexchange-nice:greenhouse:4767279101.descriptionHtml:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;At NiCE, we don’t limit our challenges. We challenge our limits. Always. We’re ambitious. We’re game changers. And we play to win. We set the highest standards and execute beyond them. And if you’re like us, we can offer you the ultimate career opportunity that will light a fire within you.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;So, what’s the role all about?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;NiCE enables organizations to address today’s consumer and employee expectations by delivering effortless, consistent, and personalized digital-first experiences with CXone, the world’s leading cloud customer experience platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;CSA team is dedicated to developing groundbreaking AI products that are transforming the industry. We promote a culture of collaboration, technical excellence, and the adoption of advanced technologies at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Lead DevOps Engineer&lt;/strong&gt; to join our CSA Infrastructure group. In this role, you will take a technical leadership position, driving the design, scalability, security, and operational excellence of our cloud platforms, while mentoring engineers and shaping DevOps best practices across teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How will you make an impact?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the design, evolution, and operation of large-scale cloud infrastructure on AWS and Azure, ensuring high availability, security, resilience, and cost efficiency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive Infrastructure as Code (IaC) strategy and quality, ensuring consistency, reusability, and maintainability across environments and development groups&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a technical authority for troubleshooting complex production issues and leading root-cause analysis&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with development, QA, security, and product teams to align infrastructure with business and product needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor and guide DevOps engineers, fostering a culture of ownership, learning, and continuous improvement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead initiatives around observability, monitoring, alerting, and incident response&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively identify risks, technical debt, and optimization opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evaluate, introduce, and scale new tools, technologies, and AI-driven automation to improve efficiency and reliability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Have you got what it takes?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;BSc in Computer Science, Computer Engineering, Software Engineering, or equivalent practical experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6+ years of hands-on experience as a DevOps Engineer&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep expertise with AWS services (Azure experience is a strong advantage)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong programming and scripting skills (Python, groovy)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive experience with Infrastructure as Code (CDK / CloudFormation / Terraform)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience designing and operating CI/CD platforms (GitHub Actions, Jenkins, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid understanding of cloud-native architectures, containerized workloads, and distributed systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with monitoring, logging, alerting, and observability platforms (Grafana and Prometheus)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid hands-on experience working with Linux environments, including system troubleshooting, performance tuning, and operational best practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of security, encryption, and compliance best practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will have an advantage if you also have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
